      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$(\\sqrt{5} + 1)(\\sqrt{5} - 1) = 5 - 1 = 4\\,dm^2$.",
        "incorrect": "استعمل $(x + y)(x - y) = x^2 - y^2$ و $(\\sqrt{5})^2 = 5$."
      },
      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$S = (\\sqrt{5} + 1)(\\sqrt{5} - 1)$",
          "$S = (\\sqrt{5})^2 - 1^2$",
